WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,680
really succeeded

2
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,420
One person killed the golden elixir demon

3
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,320
I said you are a waste

4
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,160
You just refuse to accept it

5
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,480
Do you still want more exquisite pistils?

6
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:40,140
You are so cruel to you, Holy Son of Haoran

7
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:43,020
I don't have any real thoughts, yes, that's right, me too

8
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,260
Wait until I finish stepping on this flower

9
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,220
Something good will come to you soon

10
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,080
I feel like nothing good happens with him

11
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,440
How about we run away quickly?

12
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,560
I will stay with him for one more second now

13
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,720
My heart is beating nervously
